  "created": "2026-11-18T23:20:43.603Z",
  "description": "A simplified implementation of the 7-Zip API for C++, based on version 25.01 of 7-Zip. Native x64 static libraries for Windows (MSVC) and Linux (clang), Debug and Release. The Windows library is built /arch:AVX2 and requires an AVX2-capable processor; \n    the Linux library is built -march=x86-64-v2 and requires SSE4.2 and POPCNT (Nehalem or later), but not AVX. C++ projects must consume this package through packages.config; PackageReference is not supported for C++.",
  "id": "Eternal.LZMA2Simple.Native",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-18T23:28:04.97Z",
