  "projectUrl": "https://eternaldevelopments.com/lzma2simpledocs",
  "published": "2026-11-18T23:20:43.603Z",
  "readmeFile": "ReadMe.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds Linux x64 static libraries, built with clang through the WSL2 toolset at -march=x86-64-v2; they contain native ELF objects rather than LLVM bitcode, so no LTO is required downstream.  \n    Public headers now define LZMA2SIMPLE_VERSION and carry a /FAILIFMISMATCH record, so linking a mismatched library fails at link time. Public headers are now self-contained. x64 only; Win32 configurations removed. RTTI and Control Flow Guard enabled.",
